        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It's All About a Tower&quot; is a 3D vertical platformer in a pixel art and lowpoly style, which consists of climbing a tower. Each time you die or fall, you start again at the beginning and the tower change configuration among 256 possible towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548460/extras/6c30c42e3ce96ec726058cf3946fa893.avif?t=1759315512\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple gameplay: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump again when you hit the ground to jump higher.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548460/extras/7962e201f66565aac6b26e615f274bca.poster.avif?t=1759315512\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548460/extras/7962e201f66565aac6b26e615f274bca.webm?t=1759315512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548460/extras/7962e201f66565aac6b26e615f274bca.mp4?t=1759315512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying in a click has a rhythm, backing up to fly further or higher.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548460/extras/800d35d58cb4d494b90e4b126c2ceaba.poster.avif?t=1759315512\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548460/extras/800d35d58cb4d494b90e4b126c2ceaba.webm?t=1759315512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548460/extras/800d35d58cb4d494b90e4b126c2ceaba.mp4?t=1759315512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It's All About a Tower&quot; is a 3D vertical platformer in a pixel art and lowpoly style, which consists of climbing a tower. Each time you die or fall, you start again at the beginning and the tower change configuration among 256 possible towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548460/extras/6c30c42e3ce96ec726058cf3946fa893.avif?t=1759315512\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple gameplay: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump again when you hit the ground to jump higher.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548460/extras/7962e201f66565aac6b26e615f274bca.poster.avif?t=1759315512\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548460/extras/7962e201f66565aac6b26e615f274bca.webm?t=1759315512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548460/extras/7962e201f66565aac6b26e615f274bca.mp4?t=1759315512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying in a click has a rhythm, backing up to fly further or higher.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548460/extras/800d35d58cb4d494b90e4b126c2ceaba.poster.avif?t=1759315512\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548460/extras/800d35d58cb4d494b90e4b126c2ceaba.webm?t=1759315512\" type=\"video/webm; c